    "Feet rule (SCRAP Avatars 1.0.1 candidate, manifest SHA-256 9d93e1ac27c741170f976d38e9dea7c808ee855d4cfa964d37c10a2a1dc5c4a2): clip pack reference_hips_height_m 0.9015 -> 0.9167 (rest pelvis above the floor; binary chunk identical); adam, megan, elizabeth and sophie avatar.json hips fields regenerated with floor-based heights (floor offsets 0.07, -0.07, 0.28, 0.10 cm).",
    "clip-library.mjs pelvisScaleOf comment states the floor-based rule. No code change.",
    "speed_mps and left_touchdown_phase are unchanged. Acceleration, scaled by pelvis_position_scale in locomotion.mjs, changes by up to 5.9% (Elizabeth)."
